Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Kluis nuut: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault enkripteer: message sleutel: key.
>> decrypted := vault dekripteer: encrypted sleutel: key.

Uitvoer 
skryf: ['Message:'], nuwe-reël
skryf: message, nuwe-reël
skryf: ['Decrypted:'], nuwe-reël
skryf: decrypted, nuwe-reël.
